# ── cttb-ansible sysadmin toolkit ───────────────────────────────────────────
# The toolkit ships with the repo: utils/ (the CLIs, with their shared Python
# libraries in utils/sysadmintk/), .claude/skills/, .claude/hooks/,
# .claude/rules/, .claude/settings.json, .claude/.env.example, plus CLAUDE.md
# and PROJECT.md (secrets redacted). Only personal/runtime state under .claude/
# stays out of git:

# Real credential values (copy from .env.example — never commit):
.claude/.env

# Per-sysadmin local overrides:
.claude/settings.local.json

# Personal/runtime working state:
.claude/wiki-pages/
.claude/artifacts/
.claude/baselines/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/.DS_Store

# Untouched original .claude/ snapshot (personal fallback, never shipped):
.claude.bak/

# Private operator notes:
WORKPLAN.md
NOTE.md
SPRINT_PLAN.md
GEMINI.md
WIKI_UPDATE.toon
UPDATE_JOURNAL.md
CLAUDE.local.md